RainBIOS firmware for Javascript 1983
=====================================

These redistributable ROM images provide the browser edition's Philips
NMS 8250 profile:

  rainbios_msx2.rom           MSX2 main BIOS, 32 KiB
  rainbios_msx2_sub.rom       MSX2 Sub-ROM, 16 KiB
  rainbios_nms8250_disk.rom   Philips WD2793 disk ROM, 16 KiB

They were built from RainBIOS commit
fae75a2410e84f564e12e0755f936fccf9de42d9:

  https://github.com/salvogendut/rainbios

SHA-256:

  55acd7142ece592fa1dcf253b13bc0f05c5d5acdafa80e22019c8136f15ae939  rainbios_msx2.rom
  f8230c25f45db88d4c032e59dd714c4bf65c1b3300000fc20a046fa32ef984ed  rainbios_msx2_sub.rom
